;
; How Conch files a sound alert's mapping, in MYRA: the sound kind it is
; for, and how many pulses of screen flash and of vibration show it. Eve
; says what the values may mean; this says whether they make a record.
^ZXCONCH(sound:i1) = flash:i1! ^ vibrate:i1!
